sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Notebook / Script)
    participant Library as ai4rag Library<br/>(In-Process)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MaaS as MaaS Endpoint<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant VectorDB as Vector Store<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Neo4j)
    participant Client as External Client
    participant StarterKit as Agentic RAG Service<br/>8080/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,VectorDB: Flow 1: RAG Optimization Experiment
        User->>Library: Run optimization experiment<br/>(Python API)
        Library->>S3: Discover & download documents<br/>HTTPS/443 · AWS IAM
        S3-->>Library: Document artifacts
        Library->>Library: Docling text extraction + chunking
        Library->>MaaS: Generate embeddings<br/>HTTPS · Bearer API key
        MaaS-->>Library: Embedding vectors
        Library->>VectorDB: Index chunks + embeddings<br/>TLS · Token/Password
        VectorDB-->>Library: Indexed
        loop For each optimization trial
            Library->>VectorDB: Similarity search<br/>TLS · Token/Password
            VectorDB-->>Library: Retrieved chunks
            Library->>MaaS: Chat/completions (RAG generation)<br/>HTTPS · Bearer API key
            MaaS-->>Library: Generated response
            Library->>MaaS: Evaluate (LLM-as-Judge)<br/>HTTPS · Bearer API key
            MaaS-->>Library: Evaluation score
            Library->>Library: GAM optimizer updates
        end
        Library-->>User: Best pattern + leaderboard
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Client,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Deployed Agentic RAG Service (Starter Kit)
        Client->>StarterKit: POST /v1/responses<br/>HTTP/8080 · Bearer K8s SA token
        StarterKit->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>HTTPS/443 · Bearer reviewer token
        K8sAPI-->>StarterKit: Auth result (valid/denied)
        StarterKit->>VectorDB: Retrieve context<br/>TLS · Token/Password
        VectorDB-->>StarterKit: Relevant chunks
        StarterKit->>MaaS: Chat/completions<br/>HTTPS · Bearer API key
        MaaS-->>StarterKit: Agent response
        StarterKit-->>Client: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 3: Document Ingestion from S3
        User->>Library: Provide S3 document path
        Library->>S3: List objects (discovery)<br/>HTTPS/443 · AWS IAM
        S3-->>Library: Object listing
        Library->>S3: Download documents<br/>HTTPS/443 · AWS IAM
        S3-->>Library: Raw documents
        Library->>Library: Docling conversion + chunking
    end
